{"synopsis":"\"Jaehee, kenapa kamu selalu bawa dua naskah?\" \"Uh, bisa aja hilang, kan.\" sebenarnya itu bohong. aku memang sengaja membawa dua naskah. Yang Satu untuk dibawa ke lokasi syuting untuk diperlihatkan ke orang lain. dan Yang satunya lagi... [Drama 'Youth Train' dapat diserap.] [Apakah anda ingin menyerapnya?] ...Aku makan! Aku menelan naskah itu, lalu aku baca manwha di ikiru dan menjadikannya sepenuhnya milikku. Kisah tentang Jaehee, seorang aktor yang mampu menyerap naskah 100%.","alternative_title":"책 먹는 배우님, The Book-Eating Actor","author":"Ttegur (떼구르), Matkkim (맛김)","artist":"Ttegur (떼구르)","chapters":[{"number":"50","chapter":"50","slug":"b423752f-0be6-41fc-8821-7cfb81f65f86","title":"Chapter 50","date":"2025-12-02"},{"number":"49","chapter":"49","slug":"6139878f-cdd1-42a6-8081-8d74d2ed7ed1","title":"Chapter 49","date":"2025-11-23"},{"number":"48","chapter":"48","slug":"c7065045-896e-4dab-b68f-e81b21fd2d8b","title":"Chapter 48","date":"2025-11-16"},{"number":"47","chapter":"47","slug":"8bf46c15-93a9-4a5c-98ef-68aa7a127567","title":"Chapter 47","date":"2025-11-02"},{"number":"46","chapter":"46","slug":"56011d86-ec05-45e7-a5df-19f986cb4586","title":"Chapter 46","date":"2025-10-26"},{"number":"45","chapter":"45","slug":"2609de97-f247-4619-95df-eed7ce94e5a3","title":"Chapter 45","date":"2025-10-19"},{"number":"44","chapter":"44","slug":"2f6568ae-e103-44d9-8c4d-9f2d6e86e053","title":"Chapter 44","date":"2025-10-12"},{"number":"43","chapter":"43","slug":"7c495a27-425a-4183-b115-dcf23ea4c23f","title":"Chapter 43","date":"2025-10-04"},{"number":"42","chapter":"42","slug":"d7c0c900-bcf6-4785-9e68-0e660b473775","title":"Chapter 42","date":"2025-09-15"},{"number":"41","chapter":"41","slug":"60e5dc4b-7a7e-47d3-b9c2-53d1dc57d491","title":"Chapter 41","date":"2025-09-08"},{"number":"40","chapter":"40","slug":"9d282cc0-132a-4f00-b0c8-1a19a1309c35","title":"Chapter 40","date":"2025-08-31"},{"number":"39","chapter":"39","slug":"52aa4a38-761d-4e35-a359-56aa9663133b